    "body": "FYI - the WebNN spec ended up using equality tests for lists (e.g. _\"If weight’s shape is not equal to « numDirections, 3 * hiddenSize, inputSize », then ...\")_ e.g. and maps (most specifically with [MLOperandDescriptor](https://webmachinelearning.github.io/webnn/#api-mloperanddescriptor) - a dictionary)\n\nI filed https://github.com/webmachinelearning/webnn/issues/792 to track adding equality definitions for these to the spec, with the idea that maybe this could be upstreamed to Infra. ",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
