    "updated_at": "2025-01-30T19:36:49Z",
    "body": "Since maps are really ordered maps, do we need to consider the ordering in equality? I notice we don't do that for (ordered) sets. I suspect that in many cases (e.g. dictionaries) the processing from JS via IDL to Infra types gives a deterministic order so I can ignore the problem, but there may be other cases where it's relevant?",
